# Bellowing Crier {1}{U} 2/1: "When this creature enters, draw a card, then discard a card." The draw comes first (CR 608.2c,
# in order), so the Forest drawn from the top of the library is in hand when the discard is chosen and may be the card
# discarded; the hand ends the same size as before the trigger. Both Moxen empty the pool exactly.

[Bot1 Deck]
Bellowing Crier
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Island x4
Forest
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Bellowing Crier.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Choose(Forest)

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Bellowing Crier.Power = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Bellowing Crier.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Graveyard = Forest
Bot1.Hand = Island; Island; Island; Island
Bot1.Library.Count = 13
